(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Makine Koruma Çiti ve Muhafazaları: EN ISO 14120 Çerçevesinde İmalat ve Tedarik | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Makine koruma çitleri, tel örgü paneller ve sabit muhafazaların imalatı: EN ISO 14120 genel şartları, EN ISO 13857 güvenlik mesafeleri, sabitleme, kapı ve kilit hazırlıkları, boya ve tedarikte dikkat edilecekler.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Makine koruma çiti imalatı","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Makine Güvenliği","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Makine Koruma Çiti ve Muhafazaları: EN ISO 14120 Çerçevesinde İmalat ve Tedarik","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Makine koruma çiti","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 dk okuma","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Bir üretim hücresinin etrafındaki tel örgü panel, bir konveyörün üstündeki sac muhafaza ya da bir presin yan kapağı... Bunlar makinenin \"basit\" parçaları gibi görünse de makine güvenliğinin doğrudan parçasıdır. Makine üreticisi bu muhafazaları tasarlar ve risk değerlendirmesine dahil eder; imalatçının görevi ise çizimdeki ölçüleri, açıklıkları ve sağlamlığı eksiksiz üretmektir.</p>\n<h2>Hangi Standartlar Konuya Girer?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> Sabit ve hareketli koruyucuların tasarımı ve yapımı için genel şartlar (dayanım, sabitleme, malzeme, görünürlük vb.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> Tehlike bölgelerine kol ve bacakla erişimi önleyen güvenlik mesafeleri; panel açıklığı ile tehlikeye olan mesafe birlikte değerlendirilir.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> Hareketli koruyucularda (kapılar) kilitleme düzenleri.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bu standartları uygulama ve makineyi uygunluk değerlendirmesinden geçirme sorumluluğu makine üreticisindedir (bkz. <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">yeni makine yönetmeliği</a>). İmalatçı için önemli olan, çizimde tanımlanan değerleri değiştirmemektir.</p>\n<h2>İmalatta Dikkat Edilecekler</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Örgü açıklığı ve tel çapı:</strong> Güvenlik mesafesi hesabı bu değerlere dayanır; \"benzer\" bir panel kullanmak hesabı geçersiz kılabilir.</li>\n<li><strong>Panel alt boşluğu ve yüksekliği:</strong> Zemin ile panel arasındaki boşluk ve toplam yükseklik çizimdeki gibi olmalı.</li>\n<li><strong>Sabitleme:</strong> Sabit koruyucular genellikle yalnızca alet ile sökülebilen bağlantılarla tutturulur; bazı durumlarda sökülünce yerinde kalan (kaybolmayan) cıvatalar istenir.</li>\n<li><strong>Kapı ve kilit hazırlıkları:</strong> Kilit şalteri, menteşe ve kapı stopları için delik ve braketlerin konumu doğru olmalı.</li>\n<li><strong>Dayanım:</strong> Çerçeve ve dikmeler, öngörülen darbe ve yaslanma yüklerine dayanacak şekilde kaynaklanır.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Yüzey ve Görünüm</h2>\n<p>Koruma çitleri çoğunlukla toz boyalı teslim edilir; dikmeler için sarı, paneller için siyah veya gri gibi renk düzenleri yaygındır. Renk ve kaplama sınıfı siparişte belirtilmeli, panellerin askı noktaları boya öncesi planlanmalıdır.</p>\n<h2>Tedarikte Kontrol Listesi</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Çizim revizyonu, panel listesi ve yerleşim planı</li>\n<li>Örgü tipi, açıklık ve tel çapı</li>\n<li>Bağlantı elemanı tipi ve sabitleme şekli</li>\n<li>Renk kodu ve kaplama</li>\n<li>Paketleme ve sahada montaj için etiketleme</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Koruma çerçevelerini, dikmeleri ve sac muhafazaları çizime göre kaynaklıyoruz; kesim, büküm, örgü panel ve toz boyayı iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz. Güvenlik tasarımı ve uygunluk değerlendirmesi makine üreticisinde kalır. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Çizime göre imalat →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Koruma çiti hangi standarda göre yapılır?</h3><p>Genel şartlar EN ISO 14120, güvenlik mesafeleri EN ISO 13857, kapı kilitleri EN ISO 14119 ile ele alınır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Panel açıklığı neden önemlidir?</h3><p>Güvenlik mesafesi hesabı açıklığa dayanır; farklı panel hesabı geçersiz kılabilir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Uygunluk sorumluluğu kimde?</h3><p>Makine üreticisinde; imalatçı çizimdeki değerlere uyar.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Siparişte neler belirtilmeli?</h3><p>Revizyon, örgü tipi ve açıklığı, bağlantı şekli, renk ve paketleme.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Koruma çiti veya muhafaza mı lazım?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Çizimleri ve panel listesini gönderin; teklifimizi hazırlayalım.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Yeni Makine Yönetmeliği (AB) 2023/1230: Makine İmalatçıları ve Tedarikçileri İçin Neler Değişiyor?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"CE İşaretli Kaynaklı İmalat: EN 1090 ve PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Kaynaklı Makine Gövdesi ve Tabanı: Dökümden Kaynaklı Konstrüksiyona Geçiş","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Sac Metal Kaynaklı Montaj Grubu Tedariki: Parça Parça mı, Komple mi Almalı?"},"en":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Machine Guard Fencing and Guards: Fabrication and Sourcing Under EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Fabricating machine guard fencing, mesh panels and fixed guards: EN ISO 14120 general requirements, EN ISO 13857 safety distances, fixings, door and interlock preparation, coating and sourcing checks.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Machine guard fencing fabrication","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Product Guide · Machine Safety","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Machine Guard Fencing and Guards: Fabrication and Sourcing Under EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Guard fencing","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min read","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>A mesh panel around a production cell, a sheet guard over a conveyor or the side cover of a press may look like the \"simple\" parts of a machine, but they are part of its safety. The machine builder designs them and includes them in the risk assessment; the fabricator's job is to produce the dimensions, openings and strength on the drawing without deviation.</p>\n<h2>Which Standards Apply?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> general requirements for the design and construction of fixed and movable guards (strength, fixing, materials, visibility, etc.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> safety distances preventing hazard zones being reached by upper and lower limbs; opening size and distance to the hazard are assessed together.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> interlocking devices for movable guards (doors).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Applying these standards and taking the machine through conformity assessment is the machine builder's responsibility (see <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">the new Machinery Regulation</a>). For the fabricator, what matters is not changing the values defined on the drawing.</p>\n<h2>Fabrication Points</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mesh opening and wire diameter:</strong> the safety distance calculation relies on them; a \"similar\" panel can invalidate it.</li>\n<li><strong>Bottom gap and height:</strong> the gap to the floor and overall height must match the drawing.</li>\n<li><strong>Fixing:</strong> fixed guards are usually held by fasteners that need a tool to remove; captive fasteners are sometimes required.</li>\n<li><strong>Door and interlock preparation:</strong> holes and brackets for interlock switches, hinges and stops must be in the right place.</li>\n<li><strong>Strength:</strong> frames and posts are welded to withstand the expected impact and leaning loads.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Finish and Appearance</h2>\n<p>Guard fencing is usually supplied powder coated; yellow posts with black or grey panels is a common scheme. Specify colour and coating class in the order and plan hanging points before coating.</p>\n<h2>Sourcing Checklist</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Drawing revision, panel list and layout plan</li>\n<li>Mesh type, opening and wire diameter</li>\n<li>Fastener type and fixing method</li>\n<li>Colour code and coating</li>\n<li>Packing and labelling for site installation</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld guard frames, posts and sheet guards to drawing; cutting, bending, mesh panels and powder coating are coordinated with our partners. Safety design and conformity assessment remain with the machine builder. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Build-to-print manufacturing →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which standard covers guard fencing?</h3><p>General requirements EN ISO 14120, safety distances EN ISO 13857, door interlocks EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Why does the panel opening matter?</h3><p>The safety distance calculation relies on it; a different panel can invalidate it.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Who is responsible for conformity?</h3><p>The machine builder; the fabricator follows the drawing values.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What should the order specify?</h3><p>Revision, mesh type and opening, fixing method, colour and packing.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Need guard fencing or machine guards?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Send drawings and the panel list; we will prepare our quote.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"New Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230: What Changes for Machine Builders and Their Suppliers?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"CE-Marked Welded Manufacturing: EN 1090 and PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Welded Machine Bases and Frames: Moving from Castings to Fabrications","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Sourcing Welded Sheet Metal Assemblies: Buy Piece by Piece or Complete?"},"de":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Schutzzäune und Schutzeinrichtungen für Maschinen: Fertigung und Beschaffung nach EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Fertigung von Maschinenschutzzäunen, Gitterpaneelen und feststehenden Schutzeinrichtungen: allgemeine Anforderungen EN ISO 14120, Sicherheitsabstände EN ISO 13857, Befestigung, Tür- und Verriegelungsvorbereitung, Beschichtung, Beschaffung.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Schutzzäune für Maschinen fertigen","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Maschinensicherheit","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Schutzzäune und Schutzeinrichtungen für Maschinen: Fertigung und Beschaffung nach EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Schutzzäune","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Ein Gitterpaneel um eine Fertigungszelle, eine Blechabdeckung über einem Förderband oder die Seitenverkleidung einer Presse wirken wie „einfache\" Maschinenteile, sind aber Teil der Maschinensicherheit. Der Maschinenhersteller konstruiert sie und berücksichtigt sie in der Risikobeurteilung; Aufgabe des Fertigers ist es, Maße, Öffnungen und Festigkeit laut Zeichnung ohne Abweichung herzustellen.</p>\n<h2>Welche Normen gelten?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> allgemeine Anforderungen an Gestaltung und Bau feststehender und beweglicher trennender Schutzeinrichtungen (Festigkeit, Befestigung, Werkstoffe, Durchsicht usw.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> Sicherheitsabstände gegen das Erreichen von Gefährdungsbereichen mit oberen und unteren Gliedmaßen; Öffnungsweite und Abstand zur Gefahrstelle gehören zusammen.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> Verriegelungseinrichtungen für bewegliche Schutzeinrichtungen (Türen).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Die Anwendung dieser Normen und die Konformitätsbewertung liegen beim Maschinenhersteller (siehe <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">neue Maschinenverordnung</a>). Für den Fertiger zählt, die in der Zeichnung definierten Werte nicht zu ändern.</p>\n<h2>Worauf es in der Fertigung ankommt</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maschenweite und Drahtstärke:</strong> Die Sicherheitsabstandsberechnung beruht darauf; ein „ähnliches\" Paneel kann sie ungültig machen.</li>\n<li><strong>Bodenfreiheit und Höhe:</strong> Spalt zum Boden und Gesamthöhe wie gezeichnet.</li>\n<li><strong>Befestigung:</strong> Feststehende Schutzeinrichtungen werden meist so befestigt, dass sie nur mit Werkzeug lösbar sind; teils sind unverlierbare Schrauben gefordert.</li>\n<li><strong>Tür- und Verriegelungsvorbereitung:</strong> Bohrungen und Halter für Sicherheitsschalter, Scharniere und Anschläge lagerichtig.</li>\n<li><strong>Festigkeit:</strong> Rahmen und Pfosten so schweißen, dass sie vorgesehene Stoß- und Anlehnlasten aufnehmen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Oberfläche und Erscheinung</h2>\n<p>Schutzzäune werden meist pulverbeschichtet geliefert; gelbe Pfosten mit schwarzen oder grauen Paneelen sind verbreitet. Farbe und Beschichtungsklasse in der Bestellung festlegen, Aufhängepunkte vor dem Beschichten planen.</p>\n<h2>Checkliste für die Beschaffung</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Zeichnungsrevision, Paneelliste und Aufstellplan</li>\n<li>Gittertyp, Maschenweite und Drahtstärke</li>\n<li>Verbindungselemente und Befestigungsart</li>\n<li>Farbcode und Beschichtung</li>\n<li>Verpackung und Kennzeichnung für die Montage vor Ort</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Schutzrahmen, Pfosten und Blechabdeckungen nach Zeichnung; Zuschnitt, Kanten, Gitterpaneele und Pulverbeschichtung koordinieren wir mit Partnern. Sicherheitskonzept und Konformitätsbewertung bleiben beim Maschinenhersteller. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Fertigung nach Zeichnung →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welche Norm gilt für Schutzzäune?</h3><p>Allgemeine Anforderungen EN ISO 14120, Sicherheitsabstände EN ISO 13857, Türverriegelung EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Warum ist die Maschenweite wichtig?</h3><p>Die Sicherheitsabstandsberechnung beruht darauf; ein anderes Paneel kann sie ungültig machen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wer ist für die Konformität verantwortlich?</h3><p>Der Maschinenhersteller; der Fertiger hält die Zeichnungswerte ein.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Was gehört in die Bestellung?</h3><p>Revision, Gittertyp und Maschenweite, Befestigung, Farbe und Verpackung.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Schutzzäune oder Abdeckungen benötigt?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Senden Sie Zeichnungen und Paneelliste; wir erstellen unser Angebot.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Neue Maschinenverordnung (EU) 2023/1230: Was ändert sich für Maschinenhersteller und Zulieferer?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"CE-gekennzeichnete Schweißfertigung: EN 1090 und PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Geschweißte Maschinenbetten und -gestelle: vom Guss zur Schweißkonstruktion","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Geschweißte Blechbaugruppen beschaffen: Einzeln oder komplett einkaufen?"},"es":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Vallados y resguardos de máquinas: fabricación y compra según EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Fabricación de vallados de protección, paneles de malla y resguardos fijos: requisitos generales EN ISO 14120, distancias de seguridad EN ISO 13857, fijaciones, preparación de puertas y enclavamientos, pintura y compra.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Vallados de protección de máquinas","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Guía de producto · Seguridad de máquinas","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Vallados y resguardos de máquinas: fabricación y compra según EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Vallados de protección","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min de lectura","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Un panel de malla alrededor de una célula, una chapa de protección sobre un transportador o la tapa lateral de una prensa parecen partes \"sencillas\" de una máquina, pero forman parte de su seguridad. El fabricante de la máquina las diseña e incluye en la evaluación de riesgos; el trabajo del taller es fabricar medidas, aberturas y resistencia del plano sin desviaciones.</p>\n<h2>¿Qué normas aplican?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> requisitos generales de diseño y construcción de resguardos fijos y móviles (resistencia, fijación, materiales, visibilidad, etc.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> distancias de seguridad para impedir alcanzar zonas peligrosas con miembros superiores e inferiores; abertura y distancia al peligro se evalúan juntas.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> dispositivos de enclavamiento para resguardos móviles (puertas).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Aplicar estas normas y la evaluación de conformidad corresponden al fabricante de la máquina (ver <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">nuevo Reglamento de Máquinas</a>). Para el taller, lo importante es no cambiar los valores definidos en el plano.</p>\n<h2>Puntos de fabricación</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Abertura de malla y diámetro de alambre:</strong> el cálculo de distancia de seguridad depende de ellos; un panel \"similar\" puede invalidarlo.</li>\n<li><strong>Hueco inferior y altura:</strong> como en el plano.</li>\n<li><strong>Fijación:</strong> los resguardos fijos suelen sujetarse con elementos que requieren herramienta; a veces se piden tornillos imperdibles.</li>\n<li><strong>Preparación de puertas y enclavamientos:</strong> taladros y soportes de interruptores, bisagras y topes en su posición.</li>\n<li><strong>Resistencia:</strong> marcos y postes soldados para soportar golpes y apoyos previstos.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Acabado</h2>\n<p>Los vallados se suministran normalmente con pintura en polvo; postes amarillos con paneles negros o grises es una combinación habitual. Indique color y clase de recubrimiento en el pedido y planifique los puntos de cuelgue antes de pintar.</p>\n<h2>Lista de comprobación de compra</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Revisión de plano, lista de paneles y plano de implantación</li>\n<li>Tipo de malla, abertura y diámetro de alambre</li>\n<li>Tipo de fijación</li>\n<li>Código de color y recubrimiento</li>\n<li>Embalaje y etiquetado para montaje en obra</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos marcos, postes y resguardos de chapa según plano; corte, plegado, paneles de malla y pintura en polvo se coordinan con socios. El diseño de seguridad y la evaluación de conformidad siguen en manos del fabricante de la máquina. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Fabricación según plano →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué norma cubre los vallados?</h3><p>Requisitos generales EN ISO 14120, distancias EN ISO 13857, enclavamientos EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Por qué importa la abertura?</h3><p>El cálculo de distancia de seguridad depende de ella.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Quién responde de la conformidad?</h3><p>El fabricante de la máquina; el taller respeta los valores del plano.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué debe indicar el pedido?</h3><p>Revisión, tipo y abertura de malla, fijación, color y embalaje.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"¿Necesita vallados o resguardos?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Envíe planos y lista de paneles; prepararemos la oferta.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Nuevo Reglamento de Máquinas (UE) 2023/1230: ¿qué cambia para fabricantes de máquinas y sus proveedores?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"Fabricación Soldada con Marcado CE: EN 1090 y PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Bancadas y bastidores de máquina soldados: de la fundición a la construcción soldada","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Compra de conjuntos soldados de chapa: ¿pieza a pieza o completos?"},"fr":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Clôtures et protecteurs de machines : fabrication et achat selon l'EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Fabrication de clôtures de protection, panneaux grillagés et protecteurs fixes : exigences générales EN ISO 14120, distances de sécurité EN ISO 13857, fixations, préparation des portes et verrouillages, revêtement et achat.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Clôtures de protection machines","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Guide produit · Sécurité machines","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Clôtures et protecteurs de machines : fabrication et achat selon l'EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Clôtures de protection","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min de lecture","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Un panneau grillagé autour d'une cellule, un capot tôlé au-dessus d'un convoyeur ou le carter latéral d'une presse semblent être des pièces « simples », mais ils font partie de la sécurité de la machine. Le constructeur les conçoit et les intègre à l'appréciation du risque ; le rôle du fabricant est de réaliser sans écart les cotes, ouvertures et la résistance du plan.</p>\n<h2>Quelles normes s'appliquent ?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120 :</strong> exigences générales de conception et de construction des protecteurs fixes et mobiles (résistance, fixation, matériaux, visibilité, etc.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857 :</strong> distances de sécurité empêchant d'atteindre les zones dangereuses avec les membres supérieurs et inférieurs ; ouverture et distance au danger vont ensemble.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119 :</strong> dispositifs de verrouillage des protecteurs mobiles (portes).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>L'application de ces normes et l'évaluation de la conformité incombent au constructeur de la machine (voir <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">nouveau règlement Machines</a>). Pour le fabricant, l'essentiel est de ne pas modifier les valeurs du plan.</p>\n<h2>Points de fabrication</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maille et diamètre du fil :</strong> le calcul de distance de sécurité en dépend ; un panneau « similaire » peut l'invalider.</li>\n<li><strong>Garde au sol et hauteur :</strong> conformes au plan.</li>\n<li><strong>Fixation :</strong> les protecteurs fixes sont généralement maintenus par des fixations démontables uniquement avec un outil ; des vis imperdables sont parfois demandées.</li>\n<li><strong>Préparation des portes et verrouillages :</strong> perçages et supports d'interrupteurs, charnières et butées bien positionnés.</li>\n<li><strong>Résistance :</strong> cadres et poteaux soudés pour supporter chocs et appuis prévus.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Finition</h2>\n<p>Les clôtures sont le plus souvent livrées thermolaquées ; poteaux jaunes et panneaux noirs ou gris sont courants. Précisez couleur et classe de revêtement à la commande et prévoyez les points d'accrochage avant laquage.</p>\n<h2>Check-list achat</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Indice du plan, liste des panneaux et plan d'implantation</li>\n<li>Type de grillage, maille et diamètre de fil</li>\n<li>Type de fixation</li>\n<li>Code couleur et revêtement</li>\n<li>Emballage et repérage pour le montage sur site</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons cadres, poteaux et capots tôlés sur plan ; découpe, pliage, panneaux grillagés et thermolaquage sont coordonnés avec nos partenaires. La conception sécurité et l'évaluation de conformité restent chez le constructeur. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Fabrication sur plan →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle norme pour les clôtures ?</h3><p>Exigences générales EN ISO 14120, distances EN ISO 13857, verrouillages EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Pourquoi la maille compte-t-elle ?</h3><p>Le calcul de distance de sécurité en dépend.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Qui est responsable de la conformité ?</h3><p>Le constructeur de la machine ; le fabricant respecte les valeurs du plan.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Que préciser à la commande ?</h3><p>Indice, type et maille du grillage, fixation, couleur et emballage.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Besoin de clôtures ou de protecteurs ?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Envoyez plans et liste des panneaux ; nous préparerons notre devis.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Nouveau Règlement Machines (UE) 2023/1230 : ce qui change pour les fabricants de machines et leurs fournisseurs","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"Fabrication Soudée Marquage CE : EN 1090 et PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Bâtis et socles de machines mécano-soudés : passer de la fonte au mécano-soudé","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Achat de sous-ensembles soudés en tôlerie : pièce par pièce ou complets ?"},"it":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Recinzioni e ripari per macchine: produzione e acquisto secondo EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Produzione di recinzioni di protezione, pannelli in rete e ripari fissi: requisiti generali EN ISO 14120, distanze di sicurezza EN ISO 13857, fissaggi, predisposizione porte e interblocchi, verniciatura e acquisto.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Recinzioni di protezione per macchine","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Guida prodotto · Sicurezza macchine","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Recinzioni e ripari per macchine: produzione e acquisto secondo EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Recinzioni di protezione","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min di lettura","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Un pannello in rete attorno a una cella, un carter in lamiera sopra un trasportatore o il fianco di una pressa sembrano parti \"semplici\" della macchina, ma fanno parte della sua sicurezza. Il costruttore li progetta e li include nella valutazione dei rischi; il compito di chi produce è realizzare senza scostamenti quote, aperture e resistenza del disegno.</p>\n<h2>Quali norme si applicano?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> requisiti generali per progettazione e costruzione di ripari fissi e mobili (resistenza, fissaggio, materiali, visibilità ecc.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> distanze di sicurezza per impedire il raggiungimento delle zone pericolose con arti superiori e inferiori; apertura e distanza dal pericolo vanno valutate insieme.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> dispositivi di interblocco per ripari mobili (porte).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Applicare queste norme e la valutazione di conformità spettano al costruttore della macchina (vedi <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">nuovo Regolamento Macchine</a>). Per chi produce conta non modificare i valori definiti a disegno.</p>\n<h2>Punti di produzione</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maglia e diametro del filo:</strong> il calcolo della distanza di sicurezza si basa su questi; un pannello \"simile\" può invalidarlo.</li>\n<li><strong>Luce a terra e altezza:</strong> come da disegno.</li>\n<li><strong>Fissaggio:</strong> i ripari fissi si fissano di solito con elementi rimovibili solo con utensile; a volte si richiedono viti imperdibili.</li>\n<li><strong>Predisposizione porte e interblocchi:</strong> fori e staffe per interruttori, cerniere e fermi nella posizione corretta.</li>\n<li><strong>Resistenza:</strong> telai e montanti saldati per sopportare urti e appoggi previsti.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Finitura</h2>\n<p>Le recinzioni sono di norma verniciate a polvere; montanti gialli e pannelli neri o grigi sono una combinazione comune. Specificate colore e classe di rivestimento nell'ordine e pianificate i punti di aggancio prima della verniciatura.</p>\n<h2>Checklist di acquisto</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Revisione del disegno, lista pannelli e layout</li>\n<li>Tipo di rete, maglia e diametro del filo</li>\n<li>Tipo di fissaggio</li>\n<li>Codice colore e rivestimento</li>\n<li>Imballo ed etichettatura per il montaggio in sito</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo telai, montanti e carter in lamiera su disegno; taglio, piegatura, pannelli in rete e verniciatura a polvere sono coordinati con i partner. Progetto di sicurezza e valutazione di conformità restano al costruttore. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Produzione su disegno →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale norma per le recinzioni?</h3><p>Requisiti generali EN ISO 14120, distanze EN ISO 13857, interblocchi EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Perché conta la maglia?</h3><p>Il calcolo della distanza di sicurezza si basa su di essa.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Chi risponde della conformità?</h3><p>Il costruttore della macchina; chi produce rispetta i valori a disegno.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Cosa indicare nell'ordine?</h3><p>Revisione, tipo e maglia della rete, fissaggio, colore e imballo.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Servono recinzioni o ripari?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Inviate disegni e lista pannelli; prepareremo l'offerta.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Nuovo Regolamento Macchine (UE) 2023/1230: cosa cambia per i costruttori di macchine e i loro fornitori?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"Produzione saldata con marcatura CE: EN 1090 e PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Basamenti e telai macchina saldati: dalla fusione alla carpenteria saldata","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Acquisto di assiemi saldati in lamiera: pezzo per pezzo o completi?"},"nl":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Machinehekwerk en afschermingen: productie en inkoop volgens EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Productie van machinehekwerk, gaaspanelen en vaste afschermingen: algemene eisen EN ISO 14120, veiligheidsafstanden EN ISO 13857, bevestiging, voorbereiding van deuren en vergrendelingen, coating en inkoop.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Machinehekwerk produceren","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Productgids · Machineveiligheid","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Machinehekwerk en afschermingen: productie en inkoop volgens EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Machinehekwerk","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min lezen","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Een gaaspaneel rond een productiecel, een plaatafscherming boven een transportband of de zijkap van een pers lijken \"eenvoudige\" machinedelen, maar ze horen bij de veiligheid van de machine. De machinebouwer ontwerpt ze en neemt ze op in de risicobeoordeling; de taak van de producent is de maten, openingen en sterkte van de tekening zonder afwijking te maken.</p>\n<h2>Welke normen gelden?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> algemene eisen voor ontwerp en constructie van vaste en beweegbare afschermingen (sterkte, bevestiging, materialen, zicht enz.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> veiligheidsafstanden om gevarenzones niet met armen en benen te kunnen bereiken; opening en afstand tot het gevaar horen bij elkaar.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> vergrendelingsinrichtingen voor beweegbare afschermingen (deuren).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Het toepassen van deze normen en de conformiteitsbeoordeling liggen bij de machinebouwer (zie <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">nieuwe Machineverordening</a>). Voor de producent telt dat de waarden op de tekening niet worden gewijzigd.</p>\n<h2>Aandachtspunten bij productie</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maaswijdte en draaddikte:</strong> de berekening van de veiligheidsafstand steunt hierop; een \"vergelijkbaar\" paneel kan die ongeldig maken.</li>\n<li><strong>Bodemvrijheid en hoogte:</strong> zoals getekend.</li>\n<li><strong>Bevestiging:</strong> vaste afschermingen worden meestal bevestigd met elementen die alleen met gereedschap los kunnen; soms zijn verliesvrije bouten vereist.</li>\n<li><strong>Voorbereiding deuren en vergrendeling:</strong> gaten en beugels voor schakelaars, scharnieren en aanslagen op de juiste plek.</li>\n<li><strong>Sterkte:</strong> frames en palen zo lassen dat ze de voorziene stoot- en leunbelasting opnemen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Afwerking</h2>\n<p>Hekwerk wordt meestal gepoedercoat geleverd; gele palen met zwarte of grijze panelen zijn gangbaar. Leg kleur en coatingklasse vast in de order en plan ophangpunten vóór het coaten.</p>\n<h2>Checklist voor inkoop</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tekeningrevisie, panelenlijst en opstellingsplan</li>\n<li>Gaastype, maaswijdte en draaddikte</li>\n<li>Bevestigingsmiddelen en -wijze</li>\n<li>Kleurcode en coating</li>\n<li>Verpakking en markering voor montage op locatie</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen frames, palen en plaatafschermingen volgens tekening; snijden, zetten, gaaspanelen en poedercoaten coördineren we met partners. Veiligheidsontwerp en conformiteitsbeoordeling blijven bij de machinebouwer. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Productie volgens tekening →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke norm geldt voor hekwerk?</h3><p>Algemene eisen EN ISO 14120, afstanden EN ISO 13857, deurvergrendeling EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Waarom is de maaswijdte belangrijk?</h3><p>De veiligheidsafstandsberekening steunt erop.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wie is verantwoordelijk voor conformiteit?</h3><p>De machinebouwer; de producent volgt de tekeningwaarden.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wat hoort in de order?</h3><p>Revisie, gaastype en maaswijdte, bevestiging, kleur en verpakking.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Hekwerk of afschermingen nodig?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Stuur tekeningen en panelenlijst; we stellen een offerte op.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Nieuwe Machineverordening (EU) 2023/1230: wat verandert er voor machinebouwers en hun leveranciers?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"Gelaste productie met CE-markering: EN 1090 en PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Gelaste machinebedden en -frames: van gietwerk naar lasconstructie","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Gelaste plaatwerksamenstellingen inkopen: per onderdeel of compleet?"},"no":{"blog_p96_guardfence_title":"Maskingjerder og vern: produksjon og innkjøp etter EN ISO 14120 | ArmaWeld","blog_p96_guardfence_meta_desc":"Produksjon av maskingjerder, nettingpaneler og faste vern: generelle krav EN ISO 14120, sikkerhetsavstander EN ISO 13857, festing, forberedelse for dører og forriglinger, belegg og innkjøp.","blog_p96_guardfence_og_title":"Maskingjerder og vern","blog_p96_guardfence_tag":"Produktguide · Maskinsikkerhet","blog_p96_guardfence_h1":"Maskingjerder og vern: produksjon og innkjøp etter EN ISO 14120","blog_p96_guardfence_breadcrumb3":"Maskingjerder","blog_p96_guardfence_read":"6 min lesing","blog_p96_guardfence_body":"<p>Et nettingpanel rundt en produksjonscelle, et platevern over en transportør eller sidedekselet på en presse kan virke som \"enkle\" maskindeler, men de er en del av maskinens sikkerhet. Maskinprodusenten konstruerer dem og tar dem med i risikovurderingen; produsentens oppgave er å lage mål, åpninger og styrke etter tegning uten avvik.</p>\n<h2>Hvilke standarder gjelder?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14120:</strong> generelle krav til konstruksjon og utførelse av faste og bevegelige vern (styrke, festing, materialer, sikt osv.).</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 13857:</strong> sikkerhetsavstander som hindrer at farlige områder nås med armer og bein; åpning og avstand til faren vurderes sammen.</li>\n<li><strong>EN ISO 14119:</strong> forriglingsinnretninger for bevegelige vern (dører).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Å anvende standardene og gjennomføre samsvarsvurderingen er maskinprodusentens ansvar (se <a href=\"yeni-makine-yonetmeligi-2023-1230.html\">ny maskinforordning</a>). For produsenten er det viktige å ikke endre verdiene på tegningen.</p>\n<h2>Punkter i produksjonen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maskevidde og tråddiameter:</strong> sikkerhetsavstandsberegningen bygger på dem; et \"lignende\" panel kan gjøre den ugyldig.</li>\n<li><strong>Bakkeklaring og høyde:</strong> som på tegning.</li>\n<li><strong>Festing:</strong> faste vern festes normalt slik at de bare kan løsnes med verktøy; noen ganger kreves fastholdte skruer.</li>\n<li><strong>Forberedelse for dører og forriglinger:</strong> hull og braketter for brytere, hengsler og stoppere på riktig sted.</li>\n<li><strong>Styrke:</strong> rammer og stolper sveises for å tåle forventede støt og lenelast.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Overflate</h2>\n<p>Gjerder leveres oftest pulverlakkert; gule stolper med svarte eller grå paneler er vanlig. Angi farge og beleggklasse i ordren og planlegg opphengspunkter før lakkering.</p>\n<h2>Sjekkliste for innkjøp</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tegningsrevisjon, panelliste og oppstillingsplan</li>\n<li>Nettingtype, maskevidde og tråddiameter</li>\n<li>Festemidler og festemåte</li>\n<li>Fargekode og belegg</li>\n<li>Pakking og merking for montasje på stedet</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser rammer, stolper og platevern etter tegning; kutting, bøying, nettingpaneler og pulverlakk koordineres med partnere. Sikkerhetskonstruksjon og samsvarsvurdering forblir hos maskinprodusenten. <a href=\"../cizime-gore-imalat.html\">Produksjon etter tegning →</a></p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken standard gjelder for maskingjerder?</h3><p>Generelle krav EN ISO 14120, avstander EN ISO 13857, dørforrigling EN ISO 14119.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvorfor er maskevidden viktig?</h3><p>Sikkerhetsavstandsberegningen bygger på den.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvem har ansvaret for samsvar?</h3><p>Maskinprodusenten; produsenten følger tegningsverdiene.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hva bør ordren angi?</h3><p>Revisjon, nettingtype og maskevidde, festing, farge og pakking.</p></div>","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_h3":"Trenger du gjerder eller vern?","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_p":"Send tegninger og panelliste; vi utarbeider tilbud.","blog_p96_guardfence_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_n26_machreg_h1":"Ny maskinforordning (EU) 2023/1230: Hva endres for maskinprodusenter og leverandørene deres?","blog_ce_isaretleme_kaynak_h1":"CE-merket sveiset produksjon: EN 1090 og PED","blog_p53_machinebase_h1":"Sveiste maskinfundament og -rammer: fra støpegods til sveisekonstruksjon","blog_p72_sheetassy_h1":"Innkjøp av sveiste platesammenstillinger: del for del eller komplett?"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
